# A capture after `this` over a map with entries: nothing can bind it, the clause is held and fails,
# and the refusal is announced once per clause on the warning channel, naming the input it was found
# in. Under `test` that is the case and its spec file, as the moved-reading warning names its positions.
rule capture_after_this { Resources.B1 { this[ nm | Type == 'AWS::S3::Bucket' ] exists } }
